  "question": {
    "text": "If the wavelength for an electron emitted from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo></math> atom is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, then energy absorbed by the electron in its ground state compared to minimum energy required for its escape from the atom, is____times.<br />[Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>626</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mi>Js</mi></math>, Mass of electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup></math>]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>De Broglie&#39;s equation for calculating the wave length<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;associated with the electron is given below</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi>mV</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Let Kinetic energy of the particle of mass &#39;m&#39; is K</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mV</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>Km</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>Km</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>mV</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>mK</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math>=Planck&#39;s constant=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>62</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup><mi>erg</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>m&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>m&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>43</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>68</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>215</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>abs</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>req</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>abs</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Energy</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>absorbed</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi>req</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow></msub><mi>Energy</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>required</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Kinetic</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>energy</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>abs</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>req</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>req</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>215</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>602</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0166</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
